\par\par \b \uc2  Polish Zloty -2: "Cheap" Dollar May Prompt Profit-Taking \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 1998\par 10:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Andrzej Fiderkiewicz, dealer at Societe Generale, said investors also are buying on expectations that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Council may reduce the zloty's monthly devaluation rate, a move that would strengthen the zloty further. \par \par \uc2  However, he said if the zloty rises any further Tuesday, investors may seek to take profits. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar's so cheap, I wouldn't be surprised if there was some profit-taking by foreign investors" before the Monetary Policy Council's meeting, he said. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be unwilling to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  just days before the Monetary Policy Council meeting. In the recent past, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has aggressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to curb the zloty's strength. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.7716 and for the mark at PLN2.0956. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is 8.7% below its parity rate, and the mark is 8.6% below parity. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 0.8% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 10% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates are between 22.90% and 23.40%. \par \par \uc2  -By Jennifer Laidlaw; 48-22 622-2766; jlaidlaw@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-07-98 \par \par \uc2  0814GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du7e05whq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
