\par\par \b \uc2  Zloty at all-time high, eyes turn to Polish c.bank. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Pawel Kozlowski \par \uc2 589 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juli 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, July 13 (Reuters) - The zloty hit a record high on Monday and analysts expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stay under upward pressure on news that Russia received a large rescue package, which brightened sentiment towards the eastern Europe. \par \par \uc2  The zloty firmed to all-time highs in post-fixing trade on Monday to around 8.47/8.35 percent above parity aaginst 8.32 percent at the fixing and Friday's fix at 8.15 percent. The zloty trades in a band of plus/minus 10 percent from parity. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the Monetary Policy Council's (RPP) meeting on Thursday, where a reduction in interest rates and possibly the zloty's crawl is expected, would now take centre stage with Russia's financial worries seen at least temporarily solved. \par \par \uc2  Some also said \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the zloty from strengthening past resistance at 8.5 percent above the parity rate. \par \par \uc2  "The zloty is approaching 8.5 percent from parity and this may possibly be the top for now as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may want to step in (with \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 )," said Andrzej Fiderkiewicz, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Societe Generale in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Monday Russia reached an agreement with the International Monetary Fund (IMF) on an emergency financing package worth a total of $22.6 billion spread over 1998 and 1999. Of this sum, Moscow would receive $14.8 billion in 1998. \par \par \uc2  "That's good news, which may create a run on Russia's debt and, thus, will probably also give a boost to the zloty and our paper," said Rafal Petsch, dealer at Bank of America Polska SA. \par \par \uc2  "The zloty has a chance to test 8.5 percent from parity on Tuesday, but the closer to the top of its band, the more vulnerable the zloty will become," Petsch added. \par \par \uc2  The zloty traded at 3.4550/00 to the dollar aaginst 3.4670 at the fixing and at 1.9150/70 to the mark versus 1.9135 at the fixing. \par \par \uc2  Monday's fixing at 8.32 pct above the trading band centre was the zloty's strongest fix ever against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket. The previous high of 8.31 percent was hit on May 5. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the 10-member RPP council could trim interest rates by some 50 to 150 bp and slow the zloty's devaluation pace on Thursday after inflation, credit growth and the current acccount balance appeared to be under control last week. \par \par \uc2  Polish T-bill yields dropped at Monday's 600 million zloty tender, with total investor demand topping 2.4 billion zlotys. The benchmark 52-week bill yield fell to 18.20 percent from an average of 18.89 percent at last week's primary auction. \par \par \uc2  On the money market short-term rates remained close to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 21.50 percent drainage floor, but dealers said they might gradually edge lower ahead of the RPP meeting. \par \par \uc2  "There are large cash surpluses at the moment and people are expecting the RPP council to cut interest rates, so depos will continue to edge lower ahead of Thursday," said Aleksandra Watroba, money market dealer at Bank Slaski SA in Katowice. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rates closed at 21.60/21.65 against opening 21.50/21.60 percent. Tomorrow/next ended flat at 21.50/21.80 percent. \par \par \uc2  ((Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax +48 22 653 9780, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du7d00vc1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
