\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging market  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  - Zloty rise tests NBP again. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mike Dolan \par \uc2 792 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 April 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, April 15 (Reuters) - A renewed rally in the zloty drew fresh bouts of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP) on Wednesday but many analysts remain bullish on both the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and local debt instruments. \par \par \uc2  Signs of moderating Polish inflation and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  determination to squeeze the inflation rate further are combining to keep upward pressure on the zloty and both short-and long-term zloty debt, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  This is partly why the latest round of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  zloty sales, which were conducted on Wednesday at between 7.30 and 7.50 per cent above the zloty's parity against a target basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , had only a minor impact. \par \par \uc2  The zloty was fixed after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 7.27 percent above parity. \par \par \uc2  The latest zloty surge started yesterday after NBP president Hanna Gronkiewicz-Waltz was quoted in a newspaper as saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  should strengthen in the long term to help curb inflation to 9.5 percent this year - a target she said was still possible. \par \par \uc2  "These comments reinforce the market view that given a choice between continued zloty strength or lower interest rates, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will opt for the former," said one dealer at a French bank in London. \par \par \uc2  "Unless the market appetite for high yields shifts suddenly, then further zloty upside is still possible despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  currently has a 10 percent daily fluctuation limit either side of its target parity. \par \par \uc2  The Polish Central Statistical Office said on Wednesday that annual Polish inflation fell to 13.9 percent in March from 14.2 percent in February. \par \par \uc2  In its latest emerging markets research note, investment bank Salomon Smith Barney said it recommended overweight positions toward Polish short and long term local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  instruments and external sovereign bonds. \par \par \uc2  "Some further upside on the zloty remains in the period ahead as the authorities cope with the surge in capital flows," the report said. \par \par \uc2  However, JP Morgan's latest Global Markets Outlook research note warned that investors' thirst for high yields in Europe may be satisfied for now and it recommended reducing exposure to the zloty market along with a cut in sterling holdings. \par \par \uc2  Buoyant international markets, led by the relentless rise in U.S. stocks, underpinned most other emerging markets on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The Czech crown shrugged off a health scare for President Vaclav Havel, who was said to have recovered well from emergency surgery. \par \par \uc2  The rouble nudged lower ahead of Friday's latest Duma vote on the new Russian prime minister. \par \par \uc2  The Israeli shekel recovered part of Tuesday's sharp drop but further volatility is expected ahead of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market liberalisation next month. \par \par \uc2  Persistent concerns about the Japanese economy and the yen continued to weigh on emerging Asia units, as many investors were tempted to take profits on strong first quarter gains. \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian rupiah underperformed in the region on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The strong Dow Jones performance also lifted Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with the International Monetary Fund's maintenance of its 4.8 percent Mexican growth forecast for 1998 helping the peso. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Salomon Smith Barney said Brazil, Colombia and Venezuela also offer attractive short-run local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  investment opportunities. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  MARKETS SNAPSHOT The following is a snapshot of emerging markets \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates. ASIA\tab   * Indonesian rupiah\tab   7,800 per dollar bid vs 7,600 late in London on Tuesday. * Malaysian ringgit 3.695 per dollar bid vs 3.69 on Tuesday. Thai baht\tab     unchanged at 39.85 per dollar. Philippine peso\tab   37.90 per dollar vs 37.95. * South Korean won\tab   1,391 per dollar vs 1,396. * Singapore dollar \tab  1.5985 per dollar versus 1.5920. Indian rupee\tab   39.69 per dollar vs 39.45. EUROPE\tab \tab  * Russian rouble\tab   at 6.1410 per dollar bid versus 6.1385 Tuesday. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  daily bid/off rates at 6.1090/6.1450 from 6.1070/6.1450 Tuesday. * Mark/Czech crown at 18.600 bid compared with 18.669 Tuesday. Zloty about 7.35 percent above its target basket parity versus 7.31/26 Tuesday. * Hungarian forint 2.25 percent above basket parity vs 2.20 pct Tuesday. Slovak crown 2.05 percent below basket parity versus 2.15 percent Tuesday. * Ukrainian hryvnia\tab   at 2.043 per dollar bid versus 2.0411 late Thursday. Romanian leu\tab   8,337 per dollar vs 8,310. AFRICA\tab \tab  * South African rand\tab   at 5.0304 per dollar vs 5.03. Kenyan shilling \tab  59.45 vs 59.40. LATIN AMERICA\tab \tab * Mexican peso weaker at 8.469 per dollar vs 8.485. Brazil's real\tab   at 1.1402 per dollar bid vs 1.1399. ((London newsroom +44 171 542 6414, fax 583 7239, uk.emergingmarkets.news@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du4f07hyg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
