\par\par \b \uc2  Polish Zloty Higher Early On Hard  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Selling \b0\par\par\uc2 338 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 1998\par 11:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty (PLN) is higher against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket early Tuesday in quiet dealing as investors continue to sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty is 6.8% above the mid-point against its basket of five key hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , up from around 6.7% at the close of trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0900 GMT, the dollar was at 3.4500 zlotys, down from Monday's fixing of PLN3.4535. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at PLN1.8750, unchanged from Monday's fixing of PLN1.8750. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was quiet as investors tracked movement in the dollar against the mark amid some zloty buying. \par \par \uc2  'I don't expect to see any big movements,' said Krzysztof Mordes, a dealer at BIG-Bank Gdanski. He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the market continued to be quiet. \par \par \uc2  Tomasz Wlad, a dealer at AmerBank, said the zloty was close to a level where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  before, but he said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not yet been checking rates at banks. \par \par \uc2  Dealers are skeptical of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the bank's monetary policy council meeting last Thursday. No statement was issued, but market participants believe recent \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been of concern. Newspapers have reported that one member of the council was not happy with the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.7017 and for the mark at PLN2.0126. \par \par \uc2  Both the dollar and the mark are 6.8% below parity. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 0.8% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 10% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates are between 24.15% and 24.30%. \par \par \uc2  -By Jennifer Laidlaw; 48-22 622-2766; jlaidlaw@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 07-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0913GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4702xiu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
