\par\par \b \uc2  Polish  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys -2: Buys $10 Mln At One Bank \b0\par\par\uc2 241 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 12:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market mid-day on Monday, buying dollars for zlotys from at least two banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came as the zloty threatened to move to more than 7% on the strong side of the parity rate, the dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At one major Western bank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a 'large' amount of dollars for zlotys at the level of 3.4285 zlotys (PLN), a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  later bought dollars for zlotys at a major Polish bank at the level of PLN3.4335, a dealer at that bank said. The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $10 million. \par \par \uc2  At around 0955 GMT, following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar was quoted at PLN3.4365, up from PLN3.4275 at the opening and from Friday's fixing of PLN3.4210. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was quoted at PLN1.8755, up from PLN1.8719 at the opening but down Friday's fixing of PLN1.8775. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.6787 and for the mark at PLN2.0114. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was quoted at 6.58% below its parity rate, while the mark was quoted at 6.76% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  -By Christopher Wellisz; 48-22 622-2766; cwellisz@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-03-98 \par \par \uc2  1010GMT \par \par \uc2 