\par\par \b \uc2  Polish Zloty Rises Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 11:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty opened higher against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket and remains steady on Monday, buoyed by positive news on the current-account deficit. \par \par \uc2  With the zloty trading at almost 7% on the strong side of the parity rate, dealers said that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely. \par \par \uc2  Around 0840 GMT, the dollar was at 3.4245 zlotys (PLN), down from PLN3.4275 at the opening but up from Friday's fixing of PLN3.4210. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at PLN1.8692, down from PLN1.8719 at the opening and from Friday's fixing of PLN1.8775. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty was being buoyed by Friday's news that the current-account deficit in January came to $894 million, slightly narrower than the $899 million deficit recorded in January 1997. \par \par \uc2  Economists said the current-account figure was positive news and could give the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  more room to cut key interest rates. \par \par \uc2  However, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman said the data, released by the Government Strategic Studies Center, were preliminary. The spokesman said that official \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  figures would likely be released this week. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.6787 and for the mark at PLN2.0114. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 7.07% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 6.91% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 0.8% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 10% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  One-week money market rates were indicated at between 23.75% and 24.62%. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Christopher Wellisz; 48-22 622-2766; cwellisz@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-03-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0907GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3u02nq8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
