\par\par \b \uc2  Polish Zloty Up Vs Basket Early;  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Move Awaited \b0\par\par\uc2 345 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 11:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty (PLN) is higher against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket in quiet trading early Thursday as the market braces itself for another possible round of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty is 6.7% above the mid-point against its basket of five key hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , up from around 6.5% at the close of trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the zloty hits around 6.75%. \par \par \uc2  Malgorzata Sawicka, a dealer at Bank Handlowy, said the market was quiet as investors waited to see if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last two trading sessions, buying dollars for zlotys in an effort to curb the zloty's rise. Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had signalled it didn't want the zloty to go more than 6.75% above the midpoint of its trading band. \par \par \uc2  Around 1010 GMT, the dollar was at PLN3.4315, down from PLN3.4325 at the open and down from Wednesday's fixing of PLN3.4390. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at PLN1.8775, practically unchanged from Wednesday's fixing of PLN1.8780. \par \par \uc2  Mariusz Dodek, dealer at Societe Generale, said investors were selling then buying hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been checking rates with different banks this morning and there was a strong possibility the bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.6765 and for the mark at PLN2.0111. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is 6.7% below its parity rate, and the mark is 6.6% below parity. \par \par \uc2  The zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 0.8% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 10% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates are between 23.30% and 23.50%. \par \par \uc2  -By Jennifer Laidlaw; 48-22 622-2766; jlaidlaw@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-03-98 \par \par \uc2  1033GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3q02lj6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
