\par\par \b \uc2  Polish c.bank Tue action stirs monetary council. \b0\par\par\uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, March 25 (Reuters) - The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Tuesday \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the zloty caused a stir in the monetary policy council (RPP) as some of its members said the RPP had agreed with the bank's board to leave the zloty alone. \par \par \uc2  "I do not understand why the NBP \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  since we agreed that it would not do it," the Gazeta Wyborcza daily reported an anonymous council member as saying. \par \par \uc2  "Maybe the situation was extraordinary, but the bank's chiefs will have to explain this," the daily quoted the RPP member as saying. \par \par \uc2  The monetary policy council is a 10-person body, headed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president, which sets the NBP's monetary policy alone and directs its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy in cooperation with the finance and economy ministries. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday the NBP bought an estimated $35 million on the interbank market when the zloty was at between 6.7-6.2 percent stronger than parity. \par \par \uc2  But another RPP member Cezary Jozefiak told Reuters he would not require any explanations from the NBP board, which implements the monetary council's decisions. \par \par \uc2  "The agreement between the RPP and the NBP board was that the NBP should act in such a way so as not to make the interpretation of the actions easy," Jozefiak said. \par \par \uc2  "I don't know what the whole council will want, but to me the board does not have to explain anything," he said. \par \par \uc2  The Tuesday \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president told the PAP news agency the bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the zloty approached to the end of its 10-percent daily trading band on either side of the parity rate. \par \par \uc2  ((Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax +48 22 653 9780, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du3p08mfk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
