\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty -2: First  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Since Feb. 25 \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 10:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  It was the first time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since it reduced the monthly devaluation rate of the zloty and widening the trading band on Feb. 25. \par \par \uc2  Since then, the zloty has surged against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, at times approaching or exceeding the level of 7% on the strong side of the band, as foreign investors bought high-yielding Polish Treasury securities. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sent a strong signal that it doesn't want the zloty stronger than 6.5% above the parity rate, one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  'We'll see if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is satisfied with 6.5% or if they want to push the zloty down to 6%' on the strong side of the band, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland early Tuesday set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.6715 and for the mark at PLN2.0106. \par \par \uc2  Around 0942 GMT, the dollar was trading at 6.46% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 6.60% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 0.8% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 10% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 24.65% and 24.85%. \par \par \uc2  -By Christopher Wellisz; 48-22 622-2766; cwellisz@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-03-98 \par \par \uc2  0953GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3o02hu7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
