\par\par \b \uc2  Polish Ctrl Bk/Dealer -2: DEM30 Million Bought \b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Februar 1998\par 14:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy Deutsche marks for zlotys at the level of PLN1.9515, a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer, at a major Western bank here, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought DEM15 million. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's purchase of marks was part of a round of purchases of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  that began in the early afternoon, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars for zlotys at the level of PLN3.5635 and marks at the level of PLN1.9519, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One dealer at a major Polish bank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought DEM15 million at DEM1.9519. \par \par \uc2  Other dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had bought between $20 million and $30 million in dollars. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the zloty reached 2.22% above the midpoint of the trading band. In recent \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the zloty has reached around 2% above the midpoint of the band. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the news that President Aleksander Kwasniewski had nominated Hanna Gronkiewicz-Waltz for a second six-year term as \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president had helped the zloty's climb in Wednesday's trading. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 1345 GMT, the dollar was quoted at PLN3.5625, slightly up from the\par opening of PLN3.5620 and up from Tuesday's fixing of PLN3.5550. The mark\par was quoted at DEM1.9520, down from PLN1.9530 at 0910 GMT Wednesday and\par down from Tuesday's fixing of PLN1.9545.\par -By Jennifer Laidlaw +48 22 622 2766; jlaidlaw@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 18-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1357GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2i01gqd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
