\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Up,  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\uc2  Possible \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 1998\par 10:55\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was higher against the dollar on Tuesday in nervous trading as the market feared another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the zloty was around 2.1% above the midpoint of the trading band. \par \par \uc2  Around 0940 GMT, the dollar was at 3.5520 zlotys, down from Monday's fixing of PLN3.5535. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at PLN1.9530, down from Monday's fixing of PLN1.9540. \par \par \uc2  Marek Cherubin, dealer at Creditanstalt, said there had been some zloty buying early in the day and that if the zloty continued to climb, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would undoubtably \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  Mateusz Bieniek, dealer at Societe Generale, said trading was quiet and nervous because of fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He also said many investors were waiting for the first meeting Tuesday of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary policy board to see if any decisions would be made that could affect the market. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.6314 and for the mark at PLN1.9999. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 2.2% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 2.3% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 22.60% and\par 23.20%.\par -By Jennifer Laidlaw; 48-22 622-2766; jlaidlaw@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  17-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0955GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010917du2h002dw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
