\par\par \b \uc2  Early zloty stable vs basket, eyes quiet trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 378 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Feb 16 (Reuters) - The zloty held steady in early Monday trade and dealers expected no major moves on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  today, but they said some foreign flows at Monday's tender might set off more \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The market may be pretty calm again. There is a holiday in the States and we don't expect large orders," said Andrzej Fiderkiewicz, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Societe Generale in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  On Monday Poland's finance ministry offers one billion zlotys worth of T-bills, whose yields are expected to inch down from the previous primary auction last week. \par \par \uc2  "Later in the day we can have some flows into T-bills and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, but turnover again will be probably low," Fiderkiewicz added. \par \par \uc2  At 0845 GMT the zloty was at 2.13/2.08 percent firmer than the parity rate against the opening's 2.14/2.04 percent. \par \par \uc2  It was at 3.5580/00 to the dollar against 3.5560/10 at the opening and at 1.9520/30 to the mark against 1.9530/40. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP) staged dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market every day last week, but analysts said the NBP's actions had a limited impact on the strong pro-zloty sentiment here. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not had any impact on the market...there's a general mood that the zloty can get stronger with people coming into the market and I don't think this will discourage them," said Ryszard Bublik, dealer at Nomura International in London. \par \par \uc2  According to dealers' estimates the NBP has already bought around $730 million through its market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the start of the year. \par \par \uc2  One-day deposits traded around the relatively low opening levels on Monday as recent \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar-buying spurred liquidity on the domestic money market. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rates traded at 22.05/22.35 against 22.00/22.45 at the start of the day and tomorrow/next were at 22.65/23.20 against 22.10/22.50. \par \par \uc2  ((Pawel Kozlowski, Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax +48 22 653 9780, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926du2g03zpj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
