\par\par \b \uc2  Polish  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys/PLN3.5430 - 2: $10 Mln Bought \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 1998\par 14:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday afternoon, buying dollars for zlotys at the level of 3.5430 zlotys (PLN), a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $10 million. \par \par \uc2  In the second round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars when the zloty reached about 2.14% above the mid point of the trading band. \par \par \uc2  The total scale of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's purchases of dollars was much smaller than it was on Friday or Monday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  One dealer estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent a total of about $60 million on Tuesday in its effort to thwart the zloty's rise. \par \par \uc2  Around 1310 GMT, the dollar was quoted at PLN3.5428, down from PLN3.5473 at the opening and from Monday's fixing of PLN3.5445. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was quoted at PLN1.9560, up from PLN1.9530 at the opening and from Monday's fixing of PLN1.9545. \par \par \uc2  One dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared to be retreating slightly from its firm defense of the level of 2% above the mid point of the band on Friday and Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 'The (\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ) is designating a new level of 2.15%' above the mid\par point, the dealer said.\par -By Christopher Wellisz; 48-22 622-2766; cwellisz@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1335GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2a014ad\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
