\par\par \b \uc2  POLISH C.BANK ACTION AGAIN PUSHES ZLOTY LOWER. \b0\par\par\uc2 461 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Februar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Feb 9 (Reuters) - The Polish zloty was forced down to two percent from the parity rate by repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar-buying early on Monday, but dealers said that incoming foreign capital kept the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under upward pressure. \par \par \uc2  According to local market estimates the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP) had already bought roughly $50 million through \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday, pushing the zloty down from intraday highs around 2.2 percent. \par \par \uc2  At 0920 GMT the zloty was at 1.99/1.94 percent from the trading band centre against the opening's 2.14/2.04 percent. \par \par \uc2  It was at 3.5451/71 to the dollar against 3.5370/20 at the start and at 1.9570/80 to the mark against 1.9560/70. \par \par \uc2  "During the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Polish banks play the role of a broker as on the one side there is the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and on the other foreign investors who keep selling \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at good levels," one foreign bank dealer in Warsaw said. \par \par \uc2  "It is natural for the zloty to keep firming as foreigners have already decided to enter our papers and the inflows will be bigger and bigger," the dealer added. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was determined to cap zloty gains. This sentiment was strengthened by a late Friday statement by deputy NBP chief Witold Kozinski that zloty gains in the near-term would be harmful to the economy. \par \par \uc2  "A substantial strengthening of the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not be good for the economy," Kozinski told PAP news agency after the bank bought an estimated $400 million through \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday. \par \par \uc2  He also said the zloty's crawling peg devaluation rate, now at one percent per month, was unlikely to be cut in the near-term. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to buy dollars on Monday if the zloty firmed past two percent from parity. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not allow the zloty to sneak past the two percent level, at least today...while foreign capital keeps flowing in," said Malgorzata Sawicka, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Bank Handlowy SA. \par \par \uc2  Polish one-day deposit rates fell in early trade on Monday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  again injected fresh cash into the system through repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0930 GMT overnight rates traded at 21.50/22.00 percent against the opening's 23.00/23.50 percent and tomorrow/next were at 21.75/22.20 against 23.10/23.80 at the start. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not stage any drainage \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday. \par \par \uc2  ((Pawel Kozlowski, Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax +48 22 653 9780, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040130du2900gv1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
