\par\par \b \uc2  Polish  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys Dlrs Again -2: Market 'Resisting' \b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 1998\par 13:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (Dow Jones)--The Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is continuing its wave of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, buying dollars for zlotys at the level of 3.5250 zlotys (PLN), a dealer at a major Western bank said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $10 million, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  It was the second time the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars at the same bank. Earlier, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars for zlotys at the level of PLN3.5200. It also bought $10 million, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, dealers at three other banks also reported \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at levels ranging from PLN3.5200 to PLN3.5220. The scale was between $5 million and $10 million for each transaction, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a total of between $100 million and $150 million. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants to bring the zloty down to 2% above the parity rate,' said a dealer at a major Western bank. 'But there is big resistance on the market. The (\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will have to buy much more to achieve its goal,' the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said that strong foreign investor demand for Polish Treasury bills and bonds, as well as stocks, was pushing up the zloty. \par \par \uc2  At around 1300 GMT, the dollar was quoted at PLN3.5190, or about 2.18% below its morning parity rate. The Deutsche mark was quoted at around PLN1.9590, or about 2.34% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at PLN3.5976 and for the mark at PLN2.0059. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 06-02-98 \par \par \uc2  1228GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du26010t5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
