\par\par \b \uc2  EARLY ZLOTY FIRMS VS BASKET,  \highlight22\uc2 CENTRAL BANK \highlight\uc2  QUIET. \b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Jan 23 (Reuters) - The zloty firmed in early trade and dealers expected further gains after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  initially refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise above a key resistance level of 2.15 percent. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that expectations of foreign inflows into Polish treasuries would keep the local unit bullish. \par \par \uc2  "The zloty has a chance to trade above the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels (around 2.15 percent) on Friday especially after yesterday's fixing rate, which encouraged the market to push the unit higher," said Bogdan Stepkowski, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at ING Barings in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  staged a dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier this week and knocked the zloty below two percent from parity. But on Thursday it fixed the unit steady at the market closing rate of 2.12 percent. \par \par \uc2  At 0853 GMT the zloty was at 2.24/2.18 percent stronger than parity rate against the opening's 2.15/2.09 percent. \par \par \uc2  It was at 3.5020/50 to the dollar against opening 3.5080/00 and at 1.9520/25 to the mark against 1.9520/30. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said continuing strong foreign interest in Poland's high-yielding treasuries may push the unit even higher to around 2.5 percent above parity. \par \par \uc2  "Although Polish banks are very cautious of another \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  they need to push the zloty higher due to large demand for the zloty from foreigners," said Rafal Kaminski, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Pekao SA. \par \par \uc2  On the money market early one-day deposits softened on Friday and overnight rates traded around 24.65/25.25 percent against the opening's 24.95/25.35. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow/next were at 24.75/25.25 against 24.95/25.35. \par \par \uc2  ((Pawel Kozlowski, Warsaw Newsroom, tel. +48 22 653 9700, fax +48 22 653 9780, warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040130du1n00qej\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
