 is currently devalued at a rate of 1% a month. \par \par \uc2  He said any decision on a change in the rate of zloty devaluation would depend on maintaining a tight fiscal policy. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0917GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcc09jub\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
