\par\par \b \uc2  REPEAT: Emerging-Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Down, But Steadier \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 1997\par 18:40\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par r/sf r/tu r/isr e-LCL00676\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par LONDON (Dow Jones)--Emerging markets \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Europe, the Middle\par East and Africa were lower Tuesday, reflecting the turmoil in\par international financial markets that followed the record 554-point\par decline in the Dow Jones Industrial Average Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  However, the speed of the decline appeared to be easing by midday in Europ The Polish zloty experienced the sharpest fall, declining 2.5% against the dollar. But an official of the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw no reason to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We don't see any reason to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the time being," said Krzysztof Majczuk, director of the Foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 Operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  Department. "Of course, we are watching the marketinvestors withdrew rom zloty-denominated Treasury bills, bonds and other assets. \par \par \uc2  Around 1312 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 3.5560 zlotys, up from Monday's fixing of 3.4680 zlotys. The zloty dropped to about 3.7% below the midpoint of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, compared with about 0.14% below the mid-point late on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Some market observers said the central ban to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the zloty within its trading band of plus or minus 7% around the central parity rate, which is pegged to a basket of Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "At some point we could see the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  come in and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the zloty," said David Simmonds, emerging markets \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at Citibank in London. But he said it was unlikely the zloty would be devalued. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT  28-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1740GMT \par \par \uc2  1192 1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011006dtas00czr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
