basket of Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'At some point we could see the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  come in and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the zloty,' said David Simmonds, emerging markets \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at Citibank in London. But he said it was unlikely the zloty would be devalued. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1326GMT \par \par \uc2  1192 4208 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtas0899c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
