\par\par \b \uc2  Poland Zloty Seen Stable, Barring Big Intl. Downswings \b0\par\par\uc2  By Christopher Wellisz \par \uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 1997\par 17:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty is likely to remain stable on Wednesday barring further steep declines on Wall Street and other major share markets, participants said. \par \par \uc2  After dropping sharply in the early hours of trading Tuesday in response to a 540-point decline in the Dow Jones Industrial Average Monday, the Polish zloty stabilized and even regained some ground. \par \par \uc2  'Late in the day, we saw some foreign investors buying zlotys to take advantage of new, lower levels,' said Bogdan Stepkowski, chief of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  desk at ING Barings in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, an official of the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw no reason to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the zloty, even as it fell to about 4% below the midpoint of its trading band. The zloty is allowed to trade 7% above or below a central rate against a basket of Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  By the end of the day, the zloty recovered to about 3% below the midpoint. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar at 3.5200 zlotys on Tuesday afternoon, up from Monday's fixing of 3.4680 zlotys. It fixed the Deutsche mark at 2.0410 zlotys, up from Monday's fixing of 1.9660 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The zloty's drop was sparked by sales of Polish assets by foreign investors seeking to take profits in Poland in order to cover their losses elsewhere in the world, dealers said. Alarmed, Polish banks soon joined in to buy hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1614GMT \par \par \uc2  1135 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtas083t2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
