\par\par \b \uc2  Poland's Zloty Gains Against Basket In Calm Dealing \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Oktober 1997\par 12:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty strengthened slightly against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket in calm pre-weekend dealing on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0955 GMT, the dollar was at 3.4015 zlotys, down from 3.4025 zlotys at the opening but up from Thursday's fixing of 3.3915 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.9339 zlotys, down from 1.9343 zlotys at the opening and from Thursday's fixing of 1.9405 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Early dealing was marked by traders selling dollars to buy Treasury bills on the secondary market, said a dealer at BIG Bank Gdanski. But later the zloty started tracking movements in the dollar-mark, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers continued to wondered whether and at what level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would step in again to buy hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  for several days. \par \par \uc2  'We're counting on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.4489 zlotys and for the mark at 1.9624 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 1.37% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 1.45% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within plus or minus 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 23.30% and 23.80%. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Christopher Wellisz; 48-22 622-2766; cwellisz@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-10-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1017GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtah07wnp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
