\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  Zloty Steady Vs Basket;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen Unlikely \b0\par\par\uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Oktober 1997\par 12:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was steady against a basket of five \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in quiet dealing Tuesday, with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  considered unlikely. \par \par \uc2  Around 1000 GMT, the dollar was at 3.3920 zlotys, down from 3.3943 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 3.3950 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.9404 zlotys, up from 1.9385 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 1.9360 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'The market is disciplined,' said Konrad Kolaszynski, a trader at Amerbank. He noted the zloty was trading at around 1.25% above the midpoint of its band, about the level of Monday's fixing. \par \par \uc2  With the zloty generally following movements in the dollar-mark, dealers said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'This level is acceptable to the National Bank of Poland,' said Wlodzimierz Berski, a trader at Bank Handlowy. \par \par \uc2  However, Kolaszynski predicted that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the zloty's rise could come on Wednesday after the final payments by the Bank Austria AG/Creditanstalt AG group for a stake in a Polish bank are absorbed by the market. \par \par \uc2  'Tomorrow we should see the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in action,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The Austrian group is paying 200 million zlotys for a 13% stake in Poland's Powszechny Bank Kredytowy SA. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of Poland set the parity rate for the dollar at 3.4405 zlotys and for the mark at 1.9622 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 1.41% below its parity rate, and the mark was at 1.11% below its parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The Polish zloty is fixed to a basket of five Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and is devalued at a rate of 1% per month. It is allowed to fluctuate within 7% of the central parity rate. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were steady at between 22.70% and 22.80%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1018GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 1854 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtae07pw2\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (poland near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar